@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Jobcomp a owl:Class.
hpc:KafkaPlugin a hpc:JobComp.
hpc:Produceresponse a owl:Class.
hpc:RetriableError a hpc:ProduceResponse.
hpc:PermanentError a hpc:ProduceResponse.
hpc:Success a hpc:ProduceResponse.
hpc:Jobcompparams a owl:Class.
hpc:poll_interval a xsd:nonNegativeInteger.
hpc:flush_timeout a xsd:nonNegativeInteger.
hpc:Debugflags a owl:Class.
hpc:Jobcomp a rdfs:subClassOf owl:
